thoughts you have about anxiety.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.270
So if your thoughts are
driving your anxiety

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:22.120
to become worse and we
address those thoughts,

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.780
you could potentially
cut down your anxiety

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:24.660
about your anxiety.

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:27.150
That's what CBT is,
Cognitive Behavioral Therapy.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.790
Check it out highly recommended,

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.650
not just for those who
suffer with anxiety,

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.280
