Social connections laid into your life

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.850
play a huge role in the
quality of your life

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:39.080
and the length of your life.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:40.970
These have to be meaningful
social connections,

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.150
they have to be positive ones.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:45.220
Like is it beneficial to
your health to get married?

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.760
It depends if you have a happy marriage.

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:51.570
Happy marriage, yes, very
sad abusive marriage, no.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:53.990
If you're getting positive
affection from your dog,

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:57.330
from your partner, absolutely
that's good for your health.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:58.890
It lowers your stress hormone.

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:00.630
You get a release of oxytocin,

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:01.860
which is that cuddling hormone,

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.490
makes you feel good about yourself,

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:06.030
motivates you, lowers your blood pressure.

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:08.350
In fact, affection
encourages you to do things

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:11.310
like go outside for a walk,
experience new things.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:12.960
And all of those things

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:16.620
are good for the human
mind and body, my body.

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.690
Do you know the truth about
cracking your knuckles,

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.730
or the truth about swallowing your gum?

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:22.940
Maybe what they told you isn't true.

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:25.200
Click on one of these and find out.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:26.632
Oh yeah, and stay happy and healthy.

00:11:26.632 --> 00:11:29.215
(gentle music)

